    <string-array name="preset_comment_messages">
        <item>You said you would begin. The clock disagrees.</item>
        <item>Potential is cheap. Follow-through is not.</item>
        <item>The task is still there. Avoiding it only made it older.</item>
        <item>Stop treating effort like a personality trait. Do the next thing.</item>
        <item>Your future plans are not on today&apos;s calendar. You are.</item>
        <item>Nobody is coming to finish the work you keep postponing.</item>
        <item>Be less impressive in theory and more useful in practice.</item>
        <item>You do not need a better mood. You need a smaller first step.</item>
        <item>The version of you with momentum started before feeling ready.</item>
        <item>If it matters, give it ten honest minutes instead of another excuse.</item>
    </string-array>
